## 2️⃣ Third‑party / open‑source alternatives

| Option | API source | When it shines | How to add it | Minimal code |
|--------|------------|----------------|---------------|--------------|
| **OpenStreetMap Nominatim** (public or self‑hosted) | Free OSM geocoder (search → reverse). | You need **no Mapbox token** and want an open‑data solution. | Use a generic UI library (e.g., **Leaflet Control Geocoder**, **Algolia Places**, **autocomplete.js**) and point it at the Nominatim endpoint. | ```js
import mapboxgl from 'mapbox-gl';
import Autocomplete from 'autocomplete.js'; // or any lightweight lib

const map = new mapboxgl.Map({ /* … */ });

new Autocomplete('#search-input', {
  source: (query, callback) => {
    fetch(`https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search?format=geojson&q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`)
      .then(r => r.json())
      .then(data => callback(data.features.map(f => ({
        label: f.properties.display_name,
        value: f,
      }))));
  },
  onSelect: item => {
    const [lon, lat] = item.value.geometry.coordinates;
    map.flyTo({ center: [lon, lat], zoom: 14 });
  },
});
``` |
| **Pelias / Mapzen Search** (open source) | Hosted by many providers (e.g., `https://search.mapzen.com/v1/autocomplete`). | You want a **fast, open-source geocoder** that supports POI, address, and reverse‑geocode with optional custom data. | Same pattern as Nominatim – fetch JSON → feed into a UI component. | (Same as above, just change the endpoint.) |
| **Photon** (by Komoot) | Photon is a lightweight OSM‑based geocoder (`https://photon.komoot.io/api/`). | You need **autocomplete** with low latency and a simple JSON format. | Use any autocomplete UI; Photon returns GeoJSON features. | ```js
fetch(`https://photon.komoot.io/api/?q=${query}`)
  .then(r => r.json())
  .then(d => callback(d.features.map(f => ({
    label: f.properties.name,
    value: f,
  }))));
``` |
| **Algolia Places** (deprecated but still usable) | Algolia’s hosted POI index (free tier). | You want **instant, typo‑tolerant** suggestions for cities/addresses worldwide. | Include the script from CDN, then bind to a Mapbox map manually. | ```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/places.js@1.19.0/dist/cdn/places.min.css">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/places.js@1.19.0"></script>
```<br>```js
const placesAutocomplete = places({
  appId: 'YOUR_APP_ID',
  apiKey: 'YOUR_SEARCH_ONLY_KEY',
  container: document.querySelector('#search-input')
});
placesAutocomplete.on('change', e => {
  const [lon, lat] = e.suggestion.latlng;
  map.flyTo({ center: [lon, lat], zoom: 14 });
});
``` |
